   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> 选项与<br/>配件 </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2211",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»pilot«软件的自动聚焦",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>借助主轴的数控系统（C轴），即使对于多刃刀具，也能自动对准并调整刀刃角度，从而确保测量结果不受操作人员影响。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/4/csm_csm_SK_50_high_precision_spindle-ZOLLER_e70d471b61_c389a775c3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 162
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2226",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "精确的角度测量",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>旋转编码器可全自动将C轴定位至设定角度。这使得螺旋角和分度的高精度测量以及颤动补偿成为可能。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/d/csm_csm_Vericut_measured_tool-screenshot-ZOLLER_357ae1d600_4a86f55306.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 163
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3280",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "手动微调",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>手轮可方便地对X轴和Z轴进行微调，特别适用于刀具检测。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/b/csm_csm_smile_420_fine_adjustment-ZOLLER_fd50d7b925_d8302e2c8d.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 288,
            "h": 161
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3282",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "旋转中心测量装置",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>精确调整的旋转中心可延长刀具使用寿命，从而降低您的刀具成本，同时还能缩短设置时间、减少废品，并提升工件质量。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/9/csm_csm_smile_optic_carrier_center_height_measuring_system-ZOLLER_c344e3ae11_9276a06dce.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 162
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3284",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "刀具检测",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>支持轴向和径向轮廓检测，涵盖半径、角度、距离及切削刃磨损检查，入射光照明，最大50倍放大。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/2/csm_csm_smile_venturion_450_tool_inspection-ZOLLER_3f128a74b5_ef3f06365c.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 193
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3286",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»zidCode«标签",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>借助»zidCode«，数据可以快速、轻松地打印在标签上，并可在设备上直接扫描。这意味着数据传输零差错。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/d/csm_csm_zidCode-Datentransfer-Scanner-ZOLLER_19b3ed04a4_f5a458a4de.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 162
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3288",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "手动刀具识别",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>手动将读写头移动至刀具夹紧装置上的RFID芯片位置，随后即可对芯片执行读取或写入操作。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/d/csm_csm_smile_tool_identification_hand-ZOLLER_d004fe28de_406c13087a.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 162
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3290",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "半自动刀具识别",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>读写单元在Z轴方向上手动移动，定位至刀柄上RFID芯片的高度。读写头在X轴方向的运动由CNC控制。当读写单元与RFID芯片接触时，即可对芯片进行读取和写入操作。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/b/csm_csm_smile_tool_identification_hand_and_cnc-ZOLLER_87a4f6f0dd_2170b2f144.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 290,
            "h": 162
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3292",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c2228",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
